{
    "Level 1: MISTY!": {
        "chi": "关卡 1: 米提! | c1M   Nightmares翻译 有问题请联系top游廊管理团队"
    },
    "OAK: When I was young, I was a serious POKEMON TRAINER.": {
        "chi": "奥克：当我年轻的时候，我是一个专业的宝可梦教练。"
    },
    "But now, in my old age, I have only these three left.": {
        "chi": "但现在，我已经老了，我只剩下这三个"
    },
    "You can have one. Go on choose!": {
        "chi": "你可以拥有一个 去选一个吧！"
    },
    ">>To choose your starter POKEMON<<": {
        "chi": ">>选择你的宝可梦<<"
    },
    ">>Stand on the platform with your desired POKEMON's name on it!<<": {
        "chi": ">>站在平台上，上面有您想要的宝可梦的名字！<<"
    },
    "OAK: I see! BULBASAUR is your choice, It's very easy to raise.": {
        "chi": "奥克：我明白了！妙蛙种子是您的选择，它很容易饲养."
    },
    "This POKEMON is really quite energetic!": {
        "chi": "这个宝可梦真的很有活力！"
    },
    "HUMAN's received the BULBASAUR from PROF. OAK!": {
        "chi": "人类收到了奥克教授的妙蛙种子！"
    },
    ">>TRAINER TIPS<<": {
        "chi": ">>培训师提示<<"
    },
    ">>Catch POKEMON and expand your collection.<<": {
        "chi": ">>抓住宝可梦并扩大您的收藏.<<"
    },
    ">>For now you only have 1 Pokeball.<<": {
        "chi": ">>现在你只有一个精灵球。<<"
    },
    ">>Drop a Pokeball on POKEMON marked with a white arrow to catch them!<<": {
        "chi": ">>将一个标有白色箭头的精灵球扔到宝可梦上，从而抓住他们！<<"
    },
    "Our adventure begins now!": {
        "chi": "我们的冒险现在开始！"
    },
    "The pathway for our adventure will open in 20 seconds!": {
        "chi": "我们的冒险之路将在20秒内开启！"
    },
    ">>Look out for signposts with arrows!<<": {
        "chi": ">>观察带有箭头的路标！<<"
    },
    ">>They will provide hints on where to go next!<<": {
        "chi": ">>他们将提供下一步去哪里的提示！<<"
    },
    ">>POKEMON hide in tall grass.<<": {
        "chi": ">>宝可梦躲在高高的草丛中.<<"
    },
    ">>Zigzag through grassy areas to flush them out.<<": {
        "chi": ">>穿过草地，寻觅它的踪迹.<<"
    },
    "Hold for 30 seconds.": {
        "chi": "防守30秒."
    },
    "A sleeping POKEMON blocks the way!": {
        "chi": "睡着的宝可梦挡住了路!"
    },
    "Hold for 30 seconds!": {
        "chi": "防守30秒!"
    },
    ">>You can't catch a POKEMON that belongs to someone else.<<": {
        "chi": ">>你抓不到属于别人的宝可梦.<<"
    },
    "The sleeping POKEMON left!": {
        "chi": "睡着的POKEMON离开了!"
    },
    ">>Throw POKE BALLS only at wild POKEMON to catch them.<<": {
        "chi": ">>只向野生POKEMON投掷精灵球以捕捉它们.<<"
    },
    "Hold for 15 seconds.": {
        "chi": "防守15秒."
    },
    ">>All POKEMON are unique.<<": {
        "chi": ">>所有POKEMON都是独一无二的.<<"
    },
    ">>Even POKEMON of the same POKEMON and level grow at different rates.<<": {
